      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{66ab54e69c0faef88e90dce5|full_name} I think VRChats use of Oculus is separate from OpenXR at the moment. The Meta Quest Link software had no Oculus Rift controllers working in OpenXR for like a month, didn't have the issue with VRChat. At the time the only OpenXR app I used was RiffXR. Will have to see what else supports it. \n\nI think VRChat has switching to OpenXR as a long term goal but it's good to have occasional reminder.\n\nEdit: please add OpenXR to your main post. \"Virtual Desktops OpenXR runtime\"",
